{"id":"5a745902a8dccfec","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-iota.md","title":"Definite Description Operator","display":"df-iota — Definite Description Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-iota","aliases":["58-df-iota"],"display":"df-iota — Definite Description Operator","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-iota"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-iota</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-iota — Definite Description Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,R\\in V\">\\(A,R\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq A\">\\(R\\subseteq A\\)</span> (domain and extension of a one-place condition)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IotaValue}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{IotaValue}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniqueExistence}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{UniqueExistence}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>兼容接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IotaTerm}_S(y,\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{IotaTerm}_S(y,\\Phi)\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 是元语言中带固定参数的一元条件模式，而不是从真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 到布尔值的集合函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(z)\">\\(\\Phi(z)\\)</span> 表示公式实例。该接口由下式定义，既有的集合图接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IotaValue}_S(y,R,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{IotaValue}_S(y,R,A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniqueExistence}_S(R,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{UniqueExistence}_S(R,A)\\)</span> 不变。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}value} \\vdash \\mathrm{IotaValue}_S(y,R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\land y\\in R\\land\\forall z\\in R\\;(z=y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}value} \\vdash \\mathrm{IotaValue}_S(y,R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\land y\\in R\\land\\forall z\\in R\\;(z=y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}existence} \\vdash \\mathrm{UniqueExistence}_S(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\land\\exists x\\in R\\;\\forall y\\in R\\;(y=x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}existence} \\vdash \\mathrm{UniqueExistence}_S(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\land\\exists x\\in R\\;\\forall y\\in R\\;(y=x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}term}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{IotaTerm}_S(y,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Phi(y)\\land\\forall z\\in V\\;(\\Phi(z)\\to z=y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}term}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{IotaTerm}_S(y,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Phi(y)\\land\\forall z\\in V\\;(\\Phi(z)\\to z=y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For a formula <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\)</span> under a fixed interpretation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, instantiate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\{x\\in A:\\varphi(x)\\}\">\\(R=\\{x\\in A:\\varphi(x)\\}\\)</span>. This keeps formula syntax separate from semantic application and makes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota x\\,\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\iota x\\,\\varphi(x)\\)</span> the unique <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> satisfying <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IotaValue}_S(y,R,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{IotaValue}_S(y,R,A)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IotaValue}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniqueExistence}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IotaTerm}_S(y,\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi(z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IotaValue}_S(y,R,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniqueExistence}_S(R,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}value} \\vdash \\mathrm{IotaValue}_S(y,R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\land y\\in R\\land\\forall z\\in R\\;(z=y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}existence} \\vdash \\mathrm{UniqueExistence}_S(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\land\\exists x\\in R\\;\\forall y\\in R\\;(y=x)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}term}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{IotaTerm}_S(y,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Phi(y)\\land\\forall z\\in V\\;(\\Phi(z)\\to z=y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"R=\\{x\\in A:\\varphi(x)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota x\\,\\varphi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IotaValue}_S(y,R,A)","display":false}],"bytes":1493,"backlinks":[{"id":"790ab4ebab659823","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IotaTerm}_S$（集合参数与一元公式模式的元语言关系） (see [[../batch11/58-df-iota.md]])"},{"id":"0b8de0824384672e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\iota$ (definite-description operator, see [[58-df-iota]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-iota]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-704","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-iota.md|58-df-iota]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":[]}